# Vitest — web

Config: `web/.config/vitest.config.ts`. Entry: `web/vitest.config.ts`.

Tests in:
- `web/vitests/` — plugin registration, global helpers
- `shared_modules/nuc_*/vitests/` — module-level unit tests

```bash
pnpm tests        # vitest run
pnpm test:watch   # vitest watch
```

Conventions: `vi.clearAllMocks()` in `beforeEach`; typed callbacks `(): void`; mock `nucleify` for composable tests.
